# | Feature               | **List**       | **Tuple**      | **Set**        | **Dictionary (dict)**                            |
# | --------------------- | -------------- | -------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
# | **Syntax**            | `[ ]`          | `( )`          | `{ }`          | `{key: value}`                                   |
# | **Ordered**           | ✅ Yes          | ✅ Yes          | ❌ No           | ✅ Yes (Python 3.7+)                              |
# | **Mutable**           | ✅ Yes          | ❌ No           | ✅ Yes          | ✅ Yes                                            |
# | **Allows Duplicates** | ✅ Yes          | ✅ Yes          | ❌ No           | ❌ Duplicate keys not allowed (values can repeat) |
# | **Indexing**          | ✅ Yes          | ✅ Yes          | ❌ No           | ❌ Access by key                                  |
# | **Stores**            | Values         | Values         | Unique values  | Key-value pairs                                  |
# | **Can be Changed**    | ✅ Yes          | ❌ No           | ✅ Yes          | ✅ Yes                                            |
# | **Example**           | `[10, 20, 30]` | `(10, 20, 30)` | `{10, 20, 30}` | `{"name":"Deep", "age":20}`                      |
